6 pattern and no POL-RD-09(4) phantom gantry or surcharge line.\n\nWhat would resolve this for the reviewer: an ERP gantry record for the trip, a GPS export restoring the fixes across the 18:16-18:20 tunnel gap, or a platform-derived distance independent of this trace. Any one of those would let POL-RD-07(ii) run and the deviation be decided on its merits. The open question of what happened inside the tunnel belongs to the reviewer, not to a ruling made now."
